The warning says: `[nodes[end1].outputs.matchedSubject.source] [MISSING_OUTPUT_MAPPING] "End" is missing output mapping for "matchedSubject"`

Looking at the variables-and-expressions.md, the correct format for the End node outputs is:
```json
"outputs": {
  "totalAmount": {
    "source": "=js:$vars.calculateTotal.output.amount"
  }
}
```

So the output mapping needs to be in the format `{ "matchedSubject": { "source": "=js:..." } }` not `{ "matchedSubject": "=js:..." }`.
I need to restructure the End node's outputs object to wrap each value in a source property.
